                <pb facs="0283" n="273" sameAs="frus:frus1943v01/pg273"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">852.48/1453: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Portugal</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Fish</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-03-25T14:00:00-04:00">March 25, 1943—2
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>501. Madrid’s 704, March 24 repeated to you. You are requested to address a
                    letter to Salazar concerning the transit of refugees from Spain in accordance
                    with Ambassador Hayes’ suggestion.</p>
                <p>Repeat to Madrid.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
